{
  "name": "WF07_CV_GENERATOR",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WF07_CV_GENERATOR\n\n**Objectif** : générer le PDF du CV optimisé (nommage §25), générer une lettre de motivation SEULEMENT si requise (§26), stocker sur OneDrive (`/JobAgent/GeneratedCV/YYYY/MM/`, `/JobAgent/CoverLetters/`), créer l'enregistrement `CVVersions`.\n\n⚠️ La conversion HTML→PDF utilise la fonctionnalité de conversion de format de Microsoft Graph (`?format=pdf`). Vérifiez les noms exacts des paramètres OneDrive/Extract From File selon votre version n8n installée — ils évoluent fréquemment.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 480
      },
      "id": "sticky_wf07",
      "name": "Objectif_WF07",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-280, -280]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "execute_wf_trigger_wf07",
      "name": "When_Called_By_Another_Workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [-280, 60]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "function sanitize(v) {\n  return String(v || '').normalize('NFD').replace(/[\\u0300-\\u036f]/g, '').replace(/[^a-zA-Z0-9]+/g, '_').replace(/^_+|_+$/g, '');\n}\n\nconst j = $json;\nconst now = new Date();\nconst yyyy = now.getFullYear();\nconst mm = String(now.getMonth() + 1).padStart(2, '0');\nconst dd = String(now.getDate()).padStart(2, '0');\nconst cv_file_name = `CV_Aboubacar_${sanitize(j.company)}_${sanitize(j.title)}_${yyyy}${mm}${dd}.pdf`;\nconst cl_file_name = `CoverLetter_Aboubacar_${sanitize(j.company)}_${sanitize(j.title)}_${yyyy}${mm}${dd}.pdf`;\nconst cv_folder_path = `${$vars.ONEDRIVE_ROOT_FOLDER || '/JobAgent'}/GeneratedCV/${yyyy}/${mm}`;\nconst cl_folder_path = `${$vars.ONEDRIVE_ROOT_FOLDER || '/JobAgent'}/CoverLetters/${yyyy}/${mm}`;\n\nreturn [{ json: { ...j, cv_file_name, cl_file_name, cv_folder_path, cl_folder_path } }];"
      },
      "id": "build_cv_filename",
      "name": "Build_CV_Filename",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [-40, 60]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const j = $json;\nconst s = j.cv_optimization.cv_sections;\nconst esc = (v) => String(v || '').replace(/&/g, '&amp;').replace(/</g, '&lt;').replace(/>/g, '&gt;');\nconst bulletsHtml = (bullets) => (bullets || []).map(b => `<li>${esc(b)}</li>`).join('');\nconst expHtml = (s.experience || []).map(e => `<h3>${esc(e.title)} — ${esc(e.company)}</h3><p class=\"period\">${esc(e.period)}</p><ul>${bulletsHtml(e.bullets)}</ul>`).join('');\n\nconst html = `<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><style>\nbody{font-family:Calibri,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:#1a1a1a;margin:32px;}\nh1{font-size:18pt;margin-bottom:4px;}\nh2{font-size:13pt;border-bottom:1px solid #444;margin-top:20px;}\nh3{font-size:11.5pt;margin-bottom:2px;}\n.period{font-style:italic;color:#555;margin-top:0;}\nul{margin-top:4px;}\n</style></head><body>\n<h1>Aboubacar — ${esc(j.cv_optimization.language_used)}</h1>\n<h2>Profil professionnel</h2><p>${esc(s.professional_summary)}</p>\n<h2>Compétences</h2><p>${esc((s.skills || []).join(' • '))}</p>\n<h2>Expérience</h2>${expHtml}\n<h2>Certifications</h2><p>${esc((s.certifications || []).join(' • '))}</p>\n<h2>Formation</h2><p>${esc((s.education || []).join(' • '))}</p>\n</body></html>`;\n\nreturn [{ json: { ...j, cv_html: html } }];"
      },
      "id": "render_cv_html",
      "name": "Render_CV_HTML",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [200, 60]
    },
